@startuml netguard_ingestion_dataflow
title NetGuard - Ingestion & Flow Normalisation (M1)
skinparam shadowing false

|PCAP / flow files|
start
:Read packets / flow records;
note right: data/pcap/*.pcap or flow CSV

|Importer (services/importer) - M1|
:Reassemble into flows (group by 5-tuple + time);
:Normalise to flow.v1 (protocol enum, tcp_flags, ports);
:flow_id = uuid5(...)   -> deterministic, replay-safe;
:Create trace_id (first component to touch data, F15);
:ingested_at = now()    -> p95 latency start (NFR02);
if (Valid against flow.v1.json?) then (yes)
  :Publish to topic flows.raw (key = src_ip);
else (no)
  :Log ERROR + drop (F01 input validation);
  stop
endif

|Message broker|
:flows.raw;

|Processor - M2|
:Consume -> window -> features -> detect;
stop
@enduml
